egin{enumerate}\n\\item the $n$th power map $1 + I \\to 1 + I$, $1 + x \\mapsto (1 + x)^n$\nis a bijection,\n\\item a unit of $R$ is a $n$th power if and only if its image in $R/I$\nis an $n$th power.\n\\end{enumerate}", "statement_truncated": false}
